<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="236423d3">&lt;p&gt;
    Summary level presentation that includes the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Introductions of the client personnel and EY team
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Background
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Objectives
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Scope
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Approach
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Reports and work products
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Schedule and timing
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Roles and responsibilities
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
